      "text": "To determine how many minutes it will take to print 200 pages given that the printer prints 17 pages per minute, we can use the following steps:\n\n1. Identify the rate of the printer, which is 17 pages per minute.\n2. Identify the total number of pages to be printed, which is 200 pages.\n3. Calculate the time required by dividing the total number of pages by the rate of the printer.\n\nThe calculation is as follows:\n\\[\n\\text{Time} = \\frac{\\text{Total pages}}{\\text{Pages per minute}} = \\frac{200}{17}\n\\]\n\nNow, perform the division:\n\\[\n\\frac{200}{17} \\approx 11.764706\n\\]\n\nSince we need the time to the nearest whole number, we round 11.764706 to the nearest whole number, which is 12.\n\nTherefore, the number of minutes it will take to print 200 pages is \\boxed{12}.",
